::dialogue chase-end-15
@cast Дмит | Вадим
@sound-next quest-complete
# tone: danger

Дмит: Не привыкай.
@effect-next experience 18
@effect-next flag SCHOOL_FIRST_FLOOR_PASSED
@effect-next flag DMIT_AND_VADIM_REACHED_SECOND_FLOOR
@effect-next flag GUARD_SEARCHING_SECOND_FLOOR
@next computer-branch
::end

::dialogue chase-caught-1
@cast Дмит | Охранник
@sound-next guard-shout
# tone: danger

